/E (LightGBM \(25 trials\): its best cross-validation PR-AUC score is 0.2338; it took around 21 minutes, and the best hyperparameters are: 500 estimators \(more trees\), a smaller learning rate of 0.017, 56 leaves, and 58 stays per leaf. For this model, the gain stays smaller than the fold std \(0.0037 vs 0.015\).)
