/T (With this hyperparameter tuning, it is possible to say that LightGBM remains the best model in the diabetic patients' early readmission case. However, it is important to keep in mind that the best score among many trials is slightly optimistic because it was selected on these same five folds. Nested cross-validation would correct this but costs about 5 times more to do, which is not ideal for healthcare institutions.)
