565 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 82 0 R
/E (Early hospital readmissions are costly and are often a sign that the patient did not receive enough care. Using the Diabetes 130-US Hospitals dataset, we predict at discharge whether a diabetic patient will be readmitted within 30 days. Only about 11% of the stays are readmitted, so this was an imbalanced binary classification problem. A hospital could use such a model to offer extra follow-up to the patients most at risk.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [32]
>>
endobj
