/Title (When base rates differ between groups, these definitions cannot all be satisfied at once. We therefore chose one main criterion before looking at the results: equal opportunity. In our case, the costly error is to miss a patient who will be readmitted, and being flagged is a benefit. So every patient who will be readmitted should have the same chance of being flagged, whatever their race.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1855 0 R
/Prev 2071 0 R
/Next 2117 0 R
>>
endobj
